        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: માળો",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "માળો — māḷo — \"a nest\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ચકલીએ બારી પાસે માળો બનાવ્યો. caklīe bārī pāse māḷo banāvyo. The sparrow built a nest by the window."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "માળો (māḷo) goes back to māḍa, \"an upper storey\", a form CDIAL reconstructs; CDIAL lists a Gujarati word for a loft (CDIAL 9996). How it came to mean a nest is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
